# Rollback

## When to Rollback
- Error rate spike >2x
- Critical feature broken
- Security vulnerability

## Steps

### 1. Confirm
- [ ] Rollback is right action
- [ ] Notify team
- Current version: _____
- Target version: _____

### 2. Execute
```bash
# Vercel
vercel rollback [deployment-url]

# DB migration (if needed)
npx prisma migrate rollback
```

### 3. Verify
- [ ] Service restored
- [ ] Errors normalizing
- [ ] Notify completion

## If Rollback Fails
1. Try one more version back
2. Check DB compatibility
3. Escalate to backup
